The diagram portrays the sequence of API interactions in an ORAN network setup:
- "GET POLICY TYPES" from client to API Root
- "GET POLICY TYPE DETAILS" from client to {policyTypelD}
- "GET POLICIES" from client to API Root
- "GET POLICY DETAILS" from client to {policyId}
- "GET POLICY STATUS" from client to API Root

